  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 16,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.1,
            0.105,
            0.319,
            0.121
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "ARITHMETIC PROGRESSIONS"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.873,
            0.105,
            0.899,
            0.119
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "65"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.138,
            0.628,
            0.158
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Here, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a = 1 0 0 , d = 5 0"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n = 2 1"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . Using the formula :"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.171,
            0.474,
            0.206
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_16_equation_3.jpg",
          "content": "S =   { \\frac { n } { 2 } } \\left[ 2 a + ( n - 1 )   d \\right] ,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.235,
            0.187,
            0.253
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "we have"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.219,
            0.727,
            0.318
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_16_equation_5.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{aligned} & S  = \\frac{21}{2} \\left[ 2 \\times 100 + (21 - 1) \\times 50 \\right] = \\frac{21}{2} \\left[ 200 + 1000 \\right]\\\\ &= \\frac{21}{2} \\times 1200 = 12600\\\\ \\end{aligned}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.326,
            0.728,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { S o } ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " the amount of money collected on her 21st birthday is ` 12600."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.351,
            0.837,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hasn’t the use of the formula made it much easier to solve the problem?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.376,
            0.902,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We also use "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "S _ { n }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " in place of S to denote the sum of first n terms of the AP. We write "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "S _ { 2 0 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " to denote the sum of the first 20 terms of an AP. The formula for the sum of the first n terms involves four quantities S, a, d and n. If we know any three of them, we can find the fourth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.459,
            0.9,
            0.5
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Remark :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The nth term of an AP is the difference of the sum to first n terms and the sum to first (n – 1) terms of it, i.e., "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a_{n} = S_{n} - S_{n - 1}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.505,
            0.458,
            0.523
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us consider some examples."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.536,
            0.786,
            0.555
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 11 :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Find the sum of the first 22 terms of the AP : 8, 3, –2, . . ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.967,
            0.563,
            0.982
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.561,
            0.56,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Here, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a=8, \\quad d=3-8=-5, n=22."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.587,
            0.24,
            0.605
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We know that"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.288,
            0.612,
            0.5,
            0.648
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_16_equation_15.jpg",
          "content": "S = \\frac{n}{2} \\left[ 2a + (n - 1)d \\right]"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.667,
            0.205,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.288,
            0.654,
            0.822,
            0.695
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_16_equation_17.jpg",
          "content": "S = \\frac{22}{2} \\left[ 16 + 21(-5) \\right] = 11(16 - 105) = 11(-89) = -979"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.704,
            0.59,
            0.723
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, the sum of the first 22 terms of the AP is – 979."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.736,
            0.899,
            0.774
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 12 :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " If the sum of the first 14 terms of an AP is 1050 and its first term is 10, find the 20th term."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.78,
            0.533,
            0.801
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Here, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "S_{14}=1050,\\ n=14,\\ a=10."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.822,
            0.134,
            0.838
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.363,
            0.812,
            0.589,
            0.848
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_16_equation_22.jpg",
          "content": "S_{n} = \\frac{n}{2} \\left[ 2a + (n - 1)d \\right],"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.871,
            0.131,
            0.885
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "so,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.342,
            0.855,
            0.674,
            0.895
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_16_equation_24.jpg",
          "content": "1050 = \\frac{14}{2} \\left[ 20 + 13d \\right] = 140 + 91d"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
